{"asset_key":"mn2/herohub_story_10413010","episode":"mn2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10413010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041301001:1":{"text":"휴윈, 타란 마을 사람들이 꽃이 가득한 오두막을 마련해 주었다며?","source_cn":"伊温，听说塔兰村的人在村子里为你准备了一间满是鲜花的木屋？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83D53BF9777B07CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041301002:1":{"text":"응... 밝고 널찍한 집이래.","source_cn":"嗯……据说是间明亮又宽敞的屋子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AA960AE7B598F49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1041301002":{"text":"응... 밝고 널찍한 집이래.","source_cn":"嗯……据说是间明亮又宽敞的屋子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AA960AE7B598F49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041301003:1":{"text":"음... 저는 혼자 연인의 소원에 사는 게 익숙해서요...","source_cn":"嗯……我习惯了一个人在情人之愿……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D168ACFA5E93F5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041301004:1":{"text":"타란 마을 사람들이 오염된 물을 마시고 병이 나거나 다쳤어요. 제가 치료할 때까지 버티지 못한 사람도 있구요...","source_cn":"塔兰村的大家喝了被污染的水，许多人生病和受伤。有些人甚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA8D3F0051E4B4DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docume